Ported files:

  kernel/pd_avd_core.c (GPL-2.0), from drivers/media/platform/apple/avd/avd-drv.c and
    avd-v4l2.c: notices as for avd.h above
  kernel/shim/pd_linux_shim.h (GPL-2.0): definitions after Linux include/linux/bits.h,
    bitfield.h, math.h, minmax.h, align.h, include/media/videobuf2-core.h, videobuf2-v4l2.h,
    v4l2-mem2mem.h, v4l2-ctrls.h and include/uapi/linux/videodev2.h, reduced to what the
    driver uses
